{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2615260/extras/b3a7aa59e3bbc77c1f51adf762f602c4.avif?t=1757181781\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Type\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based JRPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Story\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;There are all kinds of things in the world, and they are connected to each other like magic.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young magician who has just graduated from a magic academy embarks on a journey around the world in order to see the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After experiencing a series of events, she finds out that some of her memories and the world's memories have been erased, and struggles to find answers in various encounters and events, hoping to one day find out her forgotten past and the important bond......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Features\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. A simple fantasy journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The story consists of several simple chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each chapter has its own theme and story line</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Diverse music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Melodic theme songs and soundtracks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Easy and fast battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Easy to use turn-based battle system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_p